Package: number-cruncher
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pygame (>= 2.1), fonts-dejavu-core
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: pjob <pobrie01@gmail.com>
Description: math game: munch the numbers that fit the rule
 A Number Munchers style game. Move your Muncher around a grid of numbers
 and eat the ones that match the rule (multiples, factors, primes,
 equality and inequality) while dodging the Troggles.
